|човјеку|људима
|човјеком|људима}}

====Usage notes====
This plural form takes suppletive stem in the singular, as can be seen in the declension table. Old dual forms have been preserved in the counting for 2, 3, 4 (also in 11, 12, 13, 14 etc.) which bind plural form of {{term|sc=Cyrl|човјек|чо̏вјек|lang=sh}} / {{term|sc=Cyrl|човек|чо̏век|lang=sh}}.

